78c66d034dafecab8a8d7efa41591cedd8a23c84:docs/proxy/lens/imported/integrations/openai-agents.md:21:You need [Lens](https://github.com/BerriAI/lens/blob/main/deploy/lens/README.md), either standalone with ClickHouse or connected to LiteLLM. Open **Traces** and choose **Set up tracing** if the setup panel is not already open. Then create a tracing key, and copy the **Traces endpoint**. Keep provider credentials separate from that telemetry key. The examples support direct OpenAI calls or calls through an existing LiteLLM gateway
