78c66d034dafecab8a8d7efa41591cedd8a23c84:docs/proxy/lens/scalability.md:13:The standalone runtime stores Lens metadata and traces in ClickHouse. PostgreSQL is only a migration source. See the [current Lens benchmark procedure](https://github.com/BerriAI/lens/blob/main/docs/benchmarks.md) for the reproducible service runner and its limits.
